($s$dev.databases.nosql-modelling.q1$s$, $s$nosql$s$, $s$lesson-nosql$s$, $s$mcq$s$, $s$easy$s$, ARRAY[]::text[], $s${"id":"dev.databases.nosql-modelling.q1","skill_id":"nosql","lesson_id":"lesson-nosql","prompt":"A product can have thousands of reviews that keep growing. How should reviews be stored in MongoDB?","explanation":"Unbounded, growing data should be referenced; embedding it risks the 16 MB document limit and slow reads.","difficulty":"easy","company_tags":[],"status":"draft","ai_drafted":true,"version":1,"kind":"mcq","options":["In a separate reviews collection that references the product","As an array embedded inside the product document","As a comma-separated string field on the product","In the product's _id field"],"correct":[0]}$s$::jsonb, $s$draft$s$, TRUE, 1),
